# Context filter for `docker build -f engine/Dockerfile .`
#
# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the context
# root's `.dockerignore`, so this file scopes itself to the merged image and
# leaves the root `Dockerfile` (the core-only image, built by
# .github/workflows with the same context) seeing exactly what it saw before.
# That is the whole reason it is named this way rather than living at the root.
#
# It replaces `engine/.dockerignore`, which was never read once the build moved
# to a root context — a filter Docker ignores is worse than none, because it
# reads like protection.
#
# Deny-list rather than allow-list, deliberately. The engine's old allow-list
# cost a fix of its own (`7bc1bfe`, allowlisting vogt-mcp-auth.sh) because a
# new runtime script is invisible to the image until someone remembers this
# file. A missing deny entry costs build seconds; a missing allow entry costs
# a broken image that builds green.

# Version control and agent scratch space.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
**/.claude

# Build outputs. `web/dist` is the one exception below: it is a build *input*
# to the Rust stage (rust-embed compiles it in), but stage 1 produces it, so a
# host-built copy leaking into the context would silently win a rebuild race
# with whatever the container just built. Ignore it and let stage 1 decide.
web/dist
engine/target
target
**/node_modules
mobile/android/app/build
mobile/android/build
mobile/android/.gradle
mobile/dist
dist
build
*.egg-info

# Python local state.
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
.coverage
htmlcov

# Instance data must never enter an image.
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-wal
**/*.sqlite3-shm
data
backups

# Not built into the image: prose, tests, the mobile shell, and the compose
# files that deploy it. Each is a legitimate part of the repository and none of
# them is a build input.
docs
design
tests
scripts
mobile
deploy
**/*.md
# The one exception: `uv sync` reads it, because pyproject names it as the
# project's readme and a missing one fails the build.
!README.md

# Editor / OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea
.vscode
